sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Seed controller<br/>and grader
    participant P1 as Checkpoint<br/>interpreter P1
    participant D as Private persistent<br/>stores
    participant P2 as Verification<br/>interpreter P2
    C->>P1: Source messages and query keys only
    Note over C: Expected values stay<br/>in the controller
    P1->>D: Reopen previous session and memory
    P1->>D: Ingest next source segment
    P1->>P1: Index, recall and forced compaction
    P1->>D: Archive originals and persist active context
    P1-->>C: Observed states, answers and process identity
    Note over P1: Exit interpreter P1
    C->>P2: Start a separate fresh interpreter
    P2->>D: Reopen SQLite and the memory provider
    P2->>D: Read current evidence and run recall probes
    P2-->>C: Reopened states, answers and different startup token
    C->>C: Compare exact states and independently grade answers
    Note over P2: Exit interpreter P2
    Note over C,D: Next checkpoint starts another fresh interpreter, stores persist
